</div></div> <div n="1" type="jPoliticalNews"> <div n="2"> <div n="3" type="jArticle" xml:id="a3b" prev="#a3a"><cit><quote>&#x201E;Er war in einem großen &#x017F;chwierigen Werk, der Pacification<lb/>
