<hi rendition="#aq">Dr.</hi> <hi rendition="#g">Uhlig</hi>, Abt <hi rendition="#g">Uhlhorn</hi>, <hi rendition="#aq">Dr.</hi> <hi rendition="#g">Pfähler</hi>, <hi rendition="#aq">Dr.</hi> <hi rendition="#g">Göring</hi>,<lb/>
